WEBVTT

00:09.710 --> 00:10.410
<b>Um...</b>

00:10.760 --> 00:12.990
<b>Excuse me, but may I ask your name?</b>

00:12.990 --> 00:14.980
<b>I-It's Shinohara Hiroto.</b>

00:15.500 --> 00:17.000
<b>Shinohara-sama.</b>

00:19.990 --> 00:25.900
<b>Please excuse me. Pardon my foolishness 
for trying to hide from my new master.</b>

00:25.900 --> 00:31.010
<b><i>S-Silky hair! Small face! Big eyes! 
So cute! Even her voice is cute!</i></b>

00:31.330 --> 00:33.760
<b>Uh, may I inquire why you were hiding, miss?</b>

00:34.060 --> 00:35.810
<b>There is no need to be so formal.</b>

00:35.810 --> 00:39.270
<b>I was not informed that you 
were male, Shinohara-sama.</b>

00:40.200 --> 00:43.640
<b>Regardless, it does not change 
the fact that you are my master.</b>

00:44.050 --> 00:48.500
<b>My name is Himeji Shirayuki. I am 
enrolled in District 3's Ouka Academy,</b>

00:48.500 --> 00:51.110
<b>but on request from District 4's
Headmistress Ichinose,</b>

00:51.110 --> 00:55.040
<b>I will be your live-in assistant
starting today.</b>

00:55.770 --> 00:56.620
<b>Excuse me?</b>

02:28.000 --> 02:33.000
<b>Loyalty and 
Performance</b>

02:28.190 --> 02:29.330
<b>Here you are.</b>

02:29.330 --> 02:31.250
<b>What did you mean by "live-in"?</b>

02:31.250 --> 02:34.550
<b>I do not believe it is far 
from the conventional meaning.</b>

02:34.550 --> 02:38.550
<b>I will live and sleep in this house,
 and aid you in any way possible.</b>

02:38.550 --> 02:39.850
<b>S-Sleep here?!</b>

02:39.850 --> 02:44.330
<b>I apologize if this spoils your expectations,
 but we have separate bedrooms.</b>

02:44.590 --> 02:47.350
<b>My expecta—
It still seems bad either way.</b>

02:48.850 --> 02:52.240
<b>I guess it's okay if you don't mind, 
but I figured you might not like—</b>

02:52.240 --> 02:53.870
<b>I do not like this at all.</b>

02:53.870 --> 02:55.660
<b>So you don't like it after all!</b>

02:56.060 --> 02:59.970
<b>But that is simply because I am 
not used to being around boys.</b>

02:59.970 --> 03:03.270
<b>The true object of my hate 
is Headmistress Ichinose.</b>

03:03.270 --> 03:08.290
<b>Ah. I don't know what that's 
all about, but I think I can relate.</b>

03:08.540 --> 03:13.880
<b>What a coincidence. I have a feeling 
you and I may be able to get along, Master.</b>

03:13.880 --> 03:15.870
<b>Hey, why don't you sit down, too?</b>

03:15.870 --> 03:20.370
<b>Oh, please do not worry 
about me. I am your maid.</b>

03:20.370 --> 03:22.340
<b>Well, you're making me nervous.</b>

03:22.340 --> 03:24.780
<b>If the Headmistress requested it,
we're in the same boat.</b>

03:24.780 --> 03:26.770
<b>No need to put me on a pedestal.</b>

03:26.770 --> 03:31.290
<b>Well, all right. 
If that is what you prefer, Master.</b>

03:32.450 --> 03:36.400
<b>So you called yourself an "assistant." 
Guess that means you aren't just a housemaid.</b>

03:36.400 --> 03:37.640
<b>I see.</b>

03:38.680 --> 03:41.560
<b>Master, are you hungry at all right now?</b>

03:41.870 --> 03:42.590
<b>Huh?</b>

03:44.260 --> 03:45.450
<b>Here you are.</b>

03:45.450 --> 03:48.330
<b>A-Am I supposed to eat this all by myself?</b>

03:48.330 --> 03:50.950
<b>Yes. I may have made 
a little more than necessary.</b>

03:51.130 --> 03:53.460
<b>This isn't just a "little more."</b>

03:53.460 --> 03:55.450
<b>Are you going to eat some?</b>

03:55.450 --> 03:57.950
<b>I will dine after you, Master.</b>

03:57.950 --> 04:01.650
<b>No, no, no! We've got all this food.
 Have some while it's warm.</b>

04:01.650 --> 04:03.980
<b>If you insist, Master.</b>

04:03.980 --> 04:06.070
<b>Okay, thanks for the food.</b>

04:07.020 --> 04:10.290
<b>Th-This is great! But seriously?
 This is <i>too</i> delicious!</b>

04:10.290 --> 04:13.470
<b>It's too good to have been 
made by human hands!</b>

04:13.470 --> 04:16.490
<b>When you put it that way, 
it feels like I have been disrespected.</b>

04:16.490 --> 04:19.400
<b>If I had the vocabulary for it, 
I'd shower you with praise for hours!</b>

04:20.130 --> 04:24.280
<b>Master, you seem quite 
open about your feelings.</b>

04:24.280 --> 04:26.770
<b>Huh? Yeah, I guess so.</b>

04:26.770 --> 04:30.480
<b>I had heard that you are exceedingly 
skilled at hiding your true feelings.</b>

04:30.480 --> 04:35.030
<b>Hmm. But I can be almost too blunt 
when I know I can let my guard down.</b>

04:35.780 --> 04:37.420
<b>Let your guard down?</b>

04:37.420 --> 04:41.300
<b>Yeah. Nothing I've seen so far 
makes me think you're a bad person.</b>

04:41.300 --> 04:43.180
<b>Is that so?</b>

04:44.480 --> 04:46.350
<b>Is there any food you do not like?</b>

04:46.350 --> 04:49.970
<b>Nah, I can eat anything. 
But this really is good.</b>

04:56.090 --> 04:59.010
<b>Well, then. Let us begin 
with a detailed explanation.</b>

04:59.010 --> 05:03.100
<b>To prevent unauthorized access, 
I will display this offline.</b>

05:03.380 --> 05:06.870
<b>If anyone were to spy on us, 
it would spell the end of all this.</b>

05:06.870 --> 05:08.410
<b><i>She's right, I guess.</i></b>

05:08.410 --> 05:11.340
<b><i>By using the Red Star to 
become a fake Seven Star,</i></b>

05:09.660 --> 05:16.670
<b>Deception</b>

05:11.340 --> 05:13.380
<b><i>we're basically pulling a huge scam here.</i></b>

05:11.490 --> 05:16.540
<b>Deviousness</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:16.670
<b>Scam</b>

05:12.950 --> 05:16.670
