19:50.460 --> 19:53.960
<b>Female, 16</b>

19:50.740 --> 19:53.960
<b>You were able to pull that lie off
 because of the Red Star.</b>

19:54.330 --> 19:57.340
<b>That's right. And if you lose,
 my secret gets out.</b>

19:57.340 --> 20:01.900
<b>Whoever holds the Red Star
 can see the entire record of lies.</b>

20:02.350 --> 20:05.470
<b>So if I lose, your lies will be exposed, too.</b>

20:05.730 --> 20:09.060
<b>And if people find out I'm not the 
true daughter of the Saionji family,</b>

20:09.060 --> 20:12.470
<b>the Eimei Headmistress won't have 
a reason to protect you anymore.</b>

20:12.470 --> 20:15.730
<b>Not if the girl you beat was 
actually me, Akabane Rina.</b>

20:16.860 --> 20:19.220
<b>If that happens, I won't be 
able to stay on the Island.</b>

20:19.820 --> 20:23.360
<b>Why are you worried about that? 
Is it that important you stay?</b>

20:23.360 --> 20:25.000
<b>Yeah, it is.</b>

20:25.000 --> 20:25.870
<b>Why?</b>

20:26.210 --> 20:28.900
<b>Well, you see, I'm looking for someone.</b>

20:28.900 --> 20:31.360
<b>A childhood friend I haven't seen in years.</b>

20:31.360 --> 20:33.570
<b>I'm sure she's on this island.</b>

20:33.570 --> 20:38.240
<b>So, until I find her, 
I can't let myself get kicked out.</b>

20:39.140 --> 20:40.360
<b>In that case...</b>

20:40.750 --> 20:44.670
<b>There's only one way. I have to
pull off the lie that I'm the strongest.</b>

20:44.670 --> 20:48.270
<b>I'd rather not admit it, 
but as long as you keep winning...</b>

20:48.540 --> 20:51.360
<b>My lie and your lie will be protected.</b>

20:51.950 --> 20:53.900
<b>I guess we've formed an alliance.</b>

20:55.450 --> 20:58.530
<b>Do you want to exchange IDs 
so we can stay in touch?</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>Trending</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>Current</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>1 Hour Ago</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>3 Hours Ago</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>6 Hours Ago</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>#Shinohara Hiroto</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>#Breaking\h\h! Seven Star Victory\h\h!</b>

20:58.520 --> 21:00.530
<b>#Strongest Transfer Student</b>

20:58.530 --> 21:00.510
<b>I guess so. Wait.</b>

21:00.810 --> 21:02.240
<b>My name is trending!</b>

21:02.240 --> 21:05.270
<b>What are you talking about? 
It's been like that since you arrived.</b>

21:05.270 --> 21:11.130
<b>Ew, what's with this dude? It's all "my goddess"
 and "she isn't made for losing" and stuff.</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>Kugasaki Seiran</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>How dare you do that to my goddess\h\h\h!</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>Kugasaki Seiran</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>She isn't made for losing\h\h\h!!!</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>Kugasaki Seiran</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>I don't care if the rest of the world accepts it.</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>I don't\h\h\h!</b>

21:05.280 --> 21:12.250
<b>I reject this world\h\h\h!</b>

21:11.130 --> 21:12.740
<b>A true believer of yours?</b>

21:12.740 --> 21:15.000
<b>Well, I get all types.</b>

21:15.000 --> 21:18.790
<b>When you're as talented as I am, 
some people are bound to be mesmerized.</b>

21:18.790 --> 21:20.540
<b>Can I call you out on that one?</b>

21:21.660 --> 21:25.540
<b>B-But for now, let's try to get along.</b>

21:25.540 --> 21:28.480
<b>Yeah, let's work together.</b>

21:35.930 --> 21:38.150
<b>Welcome home, Master.</b>

21:38.150 --> 21:39.860
<b>Yeah. I'm back.</b>

21:42.070 --> 21:42.820
<b>Oh.</b>

21:44.700 --> 21:46.580
<b>What a coincidence, Shinohara!</b>

21:46.580 --> 21:49.950
<b><i>Why didn't you text me at all last night?!</i></b>

21:49.950 --> 21:51.670
<b>What's the coincidence?</b>

21:51.670 --> 21:54.830
<b>You got time to kill 
now you're not a Seven Star?</b>

21:54.830 --> 21:57.070
<b><i>Oh, crap. I fell asleep.</i></b>

21:57.070 --> 21:58.790
<b>Would you stop showing off?</b>

21:58.790 --> 22:01.870
<b>I just swung by to show you 
that you haven't broken me yet.</b>

22:05.760 --> 22:07.130
<b>Who the heck is that?</b>
